<title>USA: Teleport Communications in hospital network pact.</title>
<headline>Teleport Communications in hospital network pact.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teleport Communications Group Inc said Monday it will install a data communications network among five hospitals that are part of the SSM Health Care System in the St. Louis area.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not announced.</p>
<p>The company estimated it will serve more than one third of the St. Louis health care market with the addition of the new contract.</p>
<p>Teleport Communications provides telecommunications services in 57 metropolitan markets nationwide.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading off 7/8 Monday at 30-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
